  m_text: "Pawl the Panther needs to travel from one habitat to another, and he needs
    your help!\n\nChoose land patches to build a safe path for Pawl. But be careful\u2014you
    can only pick a limited number of patches.\n\nClick on a patch to add it to your
    path and click again to remove it.\n\nWatch your patch budget and score as you
    build Pawl\u2019s path!\n\nEach patch gives you points based on how good it is.
    Help Pawl reach his destination while earning the highest score possible!"
